{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-039", "score": 0.239, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-039 | Study family SF-CHT-039: Series-level AVOID share vs winning (talent confound)\n- observed_research_question: Series-level AVOID share vs winning (talent confound)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Higher AVOID share predicts losing, independent of team quality.\n- observed_result: Game-level rho=-0.19 p=0.008 (inflated n, team-quality confound). Series-level rho=-0.26 p=0.07 (n=50, underpowered; ~80 series needed for p<0.05). Low AVOID-share bin 52.6% vs 25-50% bin 37.0%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:confounding\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:CONFOUNDING\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Series n=50 p=0.07; still confounded by team quality (OKC disciplined and good).\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=50 series; stated need ~80 for p<0.05\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-017", "score": 0.193, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-017 | Study family SF-APPS-017: Execution conformance of observed mix vs recommended plan\n- observed_research_question: Execution conformance of observed mix vs recommended plan\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams' observed play-type mix in a game matches the model's recommended opener.\n- observed_result: Avg |delta| on leverage buckets 4.5pp to 24.0pp; 4 of 8 sides best matched opener #3, not rank-1.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- observed_failure_evidence: CUT and PNR muted for tagger floor; single-game horizon; no outcome comparison.\n- observed_sample_and_power: ~100 possessions per game\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-032\n- observed_method: Single 2025-26 playoff G1s, 4 games x 2 offenses; leverage-weighted gap between observed and recommended mix.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-027", "score": 0.148, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-027 | Study family SF-APPA-027: Agent Test B: LLM counter selection vs deterministic BEST tier\n- observed_research_question: Agent Test B: LLM counter selection vs deterministic BEST tier\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: The LLM picks the same counter as the BEST tier, and when it disagrees it is right in H2.\n- observed_result: Agrees with BEST 1/3; picks AVOID 2/3; disagreements engine right 2/2; mean H2 PPP BEST 1.650, agent 1.154, AVOID 0.642.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: n=3 triggers; caveat says 230+ disagreements needed.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=3\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: 3 suppression triggers; H2 PPP as referee.\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: A_unanswerable\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: high (0.95)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-008", "score": 0.139, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-008 | Study family SF-APPA-008: Audit of overnight LLM adaptation-analysis batch ('9/10 adaptation predicts winning')\n- observed_research_question: Audit of overnight LLM adaptation-analysis batch ('9/10 adaptation predicts winning')\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: The agent batch's findings (defensive adjustments, point costs, adaptation predicts series winners 9/10) are valid.\n- observed_result: 706 findings with n<5; list_h2h_games called 0 times; series winners LLM-inferred; MIA-BOS G7 score invented (BOS 100 vs graph 84); what_came_next skips a possession; point costs are LLM arithmetic.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Series winners never looked up (0/2073 calls); master '9/10' rule built from LLM inference on inference; low-n claims (e.g. 0.0 PPP on n=3).\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-009"}], "n_results": 4}

